# lib/ — infrastructure, not domain

If it does not know about app entities (projects, users, teams), it belongs here.

- Supabase clients: `lib/supabase/client.ts`, `server.ts`, `admin.ts`
- Generic utils: `lib/utils.ts` (`cn()` via clsx + tailwind-merge)
- Fonts: `lib/fonts.ts` (`next/font`). Used by `app/layout.tsx` and `app/global-error.tsx`
- Dates: `date-fns` named imports. Client temp IDs: `nanoid`
- Third-party SDK setup (Stripe, Resend, etc.)

`admin.ts` is server-only. Import it only from `actions/` or `app/api/` — never from Client Components, hooks, or `data/` called on the client.
